<h3 class="work-project__sub-heading">Component Architecture</h3>
<ul class="work-project__bullet-list">
  <li><strong>Reusable Component:</strong> <code>TemplateComponent</code> built with flexible props
    <ul class="work-project__bullet-list work-project__bullet-list--sub">
      <li>variant: for block vs inline styles</li>
      <li>status: for semantic intent (success, error, warning, info)</li>
      <li>children: customizable message content</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li><strong>Styled Using:</strong> BEM-style SCSS utility classes for consistent design application
  </li>
  <li><strong>Dynamic Rendering in Stories:</strong>
    <ul class="work-project__bullet-list work-project__bullet-list--sub">
      <li>Storybook story uses <code>useFirstRender()</code> hook to toggle between default and
        reactive content for live previewing component behavior</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

